  "description": "Service penetration through NMB-EW-01 with a proprietary fire collar, section. NMB Details v1.0 (2023), pp. 108-109. Opening framed using sheathing board, full fill mineral wool to the light steel frame around the penetration (325), proprietary intumescent fire collars (315) fixed through the tabs, AVCL sealed to the penetration; maximum opening 250 mm. Datum y = 0 is the pipe centre line. A free area, air brick or termination duct is provided externally.",
